  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 901.01 Aerial Applicators. All aerial applications of pesticides shall be reported within 7 days following the day of application to the division in the form and manner required under Pes 901.02(a) through (c).\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74; amd by #692, eff 9-8-75; amd by #1058.8, eff 11-22-77; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; EXPIRED: 7-19-96\n\nNew. #6316, eff 8-13-96; ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04, EXPIRED: 1-3-12\n\nNew. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14\n\nNew. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
